					This game uses AI tools in the following ways:<br />
<br />
Music: Composed using Suno.<br />
Code: Written and debugged with AI assistance.<br />
Art: Created with AI assistance.<br />
<br />
All AI-assisted content was reviewed, edited, and finalized by the developer.				</i>
			</p>
